&lt;li&gt;Experience with Git and modern software development workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with component frameworks like Material UI or similar frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in integrating AI development tools, including LLMs and code agents, into daily workflows to drive engineering efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thoughtfulness in maintaining high-quality code standards required by agentic work and in providing concise, well-scoped changes that optimize code and context windows and that maximize agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills, curiosity, and an eagerness to learn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;US citizenship and eligibility and willingness to obtain and maintain a US security clearance (Secret or above)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
