&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partnering with Product and Engineering: &lt;/strong&gt;Build fast-turnaround, high-value platform improvements alongside engineering when a trial needs something the product doesn’t yet do, and support the launch of new features with the field perspective.&lt;/li&gt;
